<title>SINGAPORE: Pokka 1st-half net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Pokka 1st-half net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				  0.43 vs  1.01</p>
<p>    Loss per share (cents)		0.51 vs  1.20</p>
<p>    Turnover				 39.65 vs 32.56</p>
<p>    Operating profit			2.14 vs  0.88</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.21 vs  0.43</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    0.21 vs  0.11</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortization	   1.34 vs  1.13</p>
<p>    Loss from associates		  0.36 vs  0.28</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  0.23 vs  0.64 (loss)</p>
<p>    Tax					 0.21 vs  0.11</p>
<p>    Minorities (expense)		  0.45 vs  0.26</p>
<p>Note - Pokka Corp (Singapore) Ltd is a soft drinks company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
